  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Continues support to Jeneusse Musicales International&apos;s &quot;Music Crossroads Strategic Program 2006-2010&quot;.The support will be funding the whole program with activities such as arrangement of local, national and inter-regional festivals for young musicians as well as relationship workshops in five countries in southern Africa.</narrative>
